# Logbook groups entries by completion day, newest first, document order within a day.
file <<END
- Old @done({today-5})
- New A @done({today})
- Mid @done({today-1})
- New B @done({today})
END
keys gL gg
see Yesterday ·
see 5 days ago ·
see ▌ ✔ New A
keys j
see ▌ ✔ New B
keys j
see ▌ ✔ Mid
keys j
see ▌ ✔ Old
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Old
- New A @done({today})
- Mid @done({today-1})
- New B @done({today})
END
